### `POST /v1/economics/route`

This is probably the **highest-value endpoint**.

Input:

```json
{
  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "workload": {
    "requests": 240,
    "uncached_input_tokens_per_request": 1000,
    "cached_input_tokens_per_request": 55000,
    "output_tokens_per_request": 200
  },
  "routes": [
