Output:

```json
{
  "cheapest": "...",
  "estimated_cost": 0.234,
  "alternatives": [],
  "assumptions": [],
  "uncomputable_routes": [],
  "market_facts_as_of": "...",
  "evidence_bundle_id": "..."
}
